baseline = "Not run: the explicit ordered gate rules prohibit pre-implementation verification; the ledger contained no prior runs and no pre-change failure is claimed."
evidence = "The hf-done ledger records the exact verified candidate revision, command, exit and private evidence path."
wiring_stats = "tools/loadtest/stats/block_collector.go (domain 16 tools): expose last committed progress with SampleCount in BlockStatsProvider; the scoped ramper derives progress time from monotonically advancing MaxBlockNumber and requires two window intervals."
wiring_receipts = "tools/loadtest/stats/collector.go and stats/logger.go (domain 16 tools): render WorkerStats.Receipts in the combined final report; worker shutdown already logs the reconciled outcomes and exposes them through ShardedSender.GetWorkerStats."
wiring_node = "rpc/send_test.go and tools/loadtest/stats/block_collector.go (domains 7 RPC and 16 tools): run the native node producer gate with canonical headers, signed submission and receipts; the scoped gate uses loopback production RPC/WebSocket codecs and Ethereum Header/Receipt types without native artifacts or external endpoints."
